
This project currently has no private libraries.

Third-party dependencies are downloaded by PlatformIO from the `lib_deps`
section of `platformio.ini`:

- MFRC522 for the RFID reader
- Adafruit GFX Library for graphics support
- Adafruit SSD1306 for the OLED display

Add a private library here only when code is shared across multiple source
files. Keep each private library in its own directory under `lib/`.
